n program had not been in existence, the unemployment rate would have risen even more than it has.\n- This option is irrelevant to the argument. The legislator is not concerned with the potential further rise in unemployment if the program had not been implemented; their focus is on the current rise in unemployment.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
