y to the assertion that it does not.\n\nA) International economic law does not cover agreements between states on maritime territorial delimitation.\n- The context, while discussing the regulation of relationships between countries, does not touch upon agreements concerning maritime territorial delimitation.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
