a basketball player who practices shooting repeatedly in the hope of leading his team to victory.\nXiao zhang is a mediocre leader who frequently instructs his employees to complete their work mindlessly and with low quality.\n- This option perfectly fits the definition of achievement motivation:.\n  - Neglecting unimportant and worthless tasks (basketball).\n  - Maintaining low standards for oneself (repeated practice).\n  - Avoiding success (team victory).\n  - Settling for mediocrity (perfect shooting).\n\nA) The answer is A. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
