 Shenzhen.\n   - **Option B**: "Small cities are more suitable for people to live in, so they can better represent a unique way of life.".\n     - This option focuses on the suitability of small cities for living but does not relate to the maturity or unfinished status of Shenzhen.\n   - **Option C**: "In cities with a long development time, the popularity of his gathering is relatively strong, so that the city is mature.Option D best supports the idea that Shenzhen, except for Luohu District, is a finished city because it explains that cities with a short development time remain immature, which aligns with the context that Shenzhen is a well-established and popular city.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
