he assertions do not provide any information about the number of crimes.They only specify the possible perpetrators and the evidence against some of them.\n\n**Option B: At least one of the above assertions is false.**.\n- This is a strong possibility.If we consider the evidence provided:.From these statements, it can be inferred that there is strong evidence that Wang Guang is the perpetrator.\n- This is definitely true.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
