ts effectiveness.\n\nB) **Most people who have survived after being trapped in collapsed buildings were rescued within two hours of the building's collapse.**.Extensive training is not required in order to operate the device effectively. It does not introduce a potential limitation or barrier to the device's widespread use. If extensive training is not needed, it might enhance the device's practical utility in emergency situations where quick deployment is crucial.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
