messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nRural culture is a set of contextual production and life experience system, which is determined by the production and living conditions of the society. in any case, the import of advanced culture from the outside to such a society is divorced from reality.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the most accurate understanding of the meaning of contextual in this paragraph?\n# Options:\nA) Adapted to the experience of production and life in various parts of the countryside\nB) Adapting to the actual development and changes in rural areas\nC) Connected with and integrated with the reality of the local rural society\nD) Adapted to the development of advanced culture', '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the context and the question step by step.\n\n1.**Understanding the Context:**.\n   - The context describes rural culture as a system that is shaped by the production and living conditions of the society.\n   - It emphasizes that any external advanced culture should be adapted to the reality of the local rural society.\n\n2.**Analyzing the Question:**.\n   - The question asks for the most accurate understanding of the term "contextual" in the given paragraph.\n   - We need to identify which option best captures the essence of the paragraph\'s meaning regarding the integration of external culture with the local reality.\n\n3.**Evaluating Each Option:**.\n   - **Option A: Adapted to the experience of production and life in various parts of the countryside**.\n     - This option focuses on the experience of production and life in different rural areas, which is not the primary focus of the paragraph.\n   - **Option B: Adapting to the actual development and changes in rural areas**.\n     - This option emphasizes adaptation to the development and changes in rural areas, which is not the main point of the paragraph.\n   - **Option C: Connected with and integrated with the reality of the local rural society**.The integration of external culture with the local reality of the rural society is not emphasized by Option C, making it less suitable for capturing the essence of the paragraph.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
