 who checked Zhao Jie.Since Zhao Jie is a candidate, Wang Ming must have ticked Zhao Jie.\n   - Li Zilu ticked all those who did not get the full vote.Since Zhao Jie is a candidate, Li Zilu must have ticked Wang Ming (since Wang Ming did not tick anyone).\n\n5.**Evaluating the Options:**Wang Ming didn't tick Li Zilu, but Li Zilu ticked Wang Ming.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
