on B: Scolari was reluctant to talk about the contest with england because he was not fully prepared.**\n     - The context mentions that Scolari is reluctant to talk about how to compete with England, but it does not provide any information about his preparation.This can be inferred.\n   - **Option C: The match against belgium was tough, so scolari was relieved after the match.**The context implies that Scolari was disappointed after defeating the Belgian team. This cannot be inferred.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
