messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe cultural industry integrates intensive talent, technology, knowledge and capital, and has distinct cross-disciplinary, cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space and cross-cultural characteristics. It will also play a central role in future personal behavior, social life and nation-building, as well as global development and human affairs. Report of the World Commission on Culture and Development of the United Nations Scientific, Educational and Cultural Organization in 1995. It is pointed out that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of the overall prosperity and development of human existence. It can be said that the cross-border characteristics and importance of culture put forward fundamental requirements for the high quality and scale of cultural talents.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the main content of this text?\n# Options:\nA) Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life\nB) Cultural talents should have high quality and scale\nC) Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development\nD) The particularity and importance of cultural industry', '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let\'s break down the context and question step by step:.\n\n1.**Context Analysis**:.\n   - The context discusses the cultural industry, highlighting its characteristics and importance.\n   - It mentions that the cultural industry integrates various elements (talent, technology, knowledge, capital) and has cross-disciplinary, cross-time-space, and cross-cultural characteristics.\n   - The text emphasizes the role of the cultural industry in future personal behavior, social life, nation-building, global development, and human affairs.\n   - It also references a report by the World Commission on Culture and Development, which states that culture is the ultimate goal and destination of overall human prosperity and development.\n\n2.**Question Analysis**:.\n   - The question asks for the main content of the text.\n   - We need to identify the central theme or the primary focus of the passage.\n\n3.**Option Analysis**:.\n   - **Option A**: "Cultural industry plays an important role in human social life".\n     - This option aligns with the text\'s emphasis on the cultural industry\'s role in future personal behavior, social life, and nation-building.\n   - **Option B**: "Cultural talents should have high quality and scale".\n     - While the text mentions the importance of cultural talents, it does not specifically state that they should have high quality and scale.\n   - **Option C**: "Culture is the ultimate goal of human prosperity and development".\n     - This is mentioned in the context, but it is not the main focus of the text.The text focuses solely on the ultimate goal of culture, rather than the cultural industry and its significance.\n   - **Option D**: "The general aspects of cultural industry".\n     - This option is too specific and fails to encompass the primary focus of the text, which is on the ultimate goal of culture.\n\n4.**Conclusion**:.\n   - The text primarily delves into the ultimate goal of culture and its impact on human life and development.\n   - Option A best reflects this central theme by emphasizing the ultimate goal of culture in human social life.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
